    "chunk_text": "\u00e6hte Hierusalem & Bethania to Oliuetes Dune, he sende his twegen leorningcnihtas. & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, fara\u00fe to \u00feam castele \u00fee inc ys, and gyt \u00fear sona gemeta\u00f0 assan folan getigedne ofer And gyf hwa to inc hw\u00e6t cwy\u00f0, secga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t drihten h\u00e6f\u00f0 his neode & he hine sona hider l\u00e6t. & \u00fea hi utferdon hi gemetton \u00feone folan ute on twycenan beforan dura getigedne; \u00fea untigdon hi & sume \u00fee \u00fear stodon \u00feus s\u00e6don him, Hw\u00e6t do gyt \u00feone folan untigende? \u00dea cw\u00e6don hi, swa se H\u00e6lend unc bead, & hi leton hi \u00fea. \u00d0a l\u00e6ddon hi \u00feone folan to \u00feam H\u00e6lende, & hi hyra reaf on aledon & he on s\u00e6t. Manega hyra reaf on \u00feone weg strehton, sume \u00fea boceras of \u00feam treowum heowon & streowodon on & \u00fea \u00f0e beforan eodon & \u00fea \u00f0e \u00e6fterfolgodon cw\u00e6don \u00feus, osanna, sy gebletsod se \u00fee com on Si gebletsod \u00fe\u00e6t rice \u00fee com ures f\u00e6der Dauides, osanna on heahnessum. And he eode \u00fea on Hierosolima templ & ealle \u00feing he besceawode; \u00fea \u00e6fentima w\u00e6s he ferde to And o\u00ferum d\u00e6ge \u00fea hi ferdon fram Bethania hine hingrode. \u00d0a he feorran geseah an fictreow \u00fee leaf h\u00e6fde, he com & sohte hw\u00e6\u00feer he \u00fear on aht funde; \u00fea he \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, heonon for\u00f0 on ecnesse ne ete \u00e6nig mann w\u00e6stm of \u00fee; & his leorningcnihtas",
